# DESIGN DECISION #002 — Dual Layout Token Isolation

**STATUS: OWNER APPROVED | PERMANENT**

```
Homepage 24px
↓ never inherit
↓ Internal Layout Tokens

Internal Layout 16px
↓ never inherit
↓ Homepage Tokens
```

Companion to Design Decision #001 (values). This decision owns **isolation**.

## Token families (independent)

| Family | Pad | CSS vars (only) |
|--------|-----|-----------------|
| Homepage | 24px | `--homepage-pad-x` · `--hp-shell-pad` |
| Internal | 16px | `--fw-pad-x` · `--internal-pad-x` · `--rx-phone-inset-x` · `--cds-space-page-x` |

## Forbidden forever

- Homepage reading/writing Internal vars
- Internal reading/writing Homepage vars
- `body:has(.rovexo-page-home)` mutating `--rx-phone-inset-x` / `--fw-pad-x` / `--cds-space-page-x`
- `--homepage-pad-x: var(--fw-pad-x)` or the reverse
- `--rx-phone-inset-x: var(--homepage-pad-x)`

## Required

- Homepage surfaces pad with **Homepage Tokens only**
- Internal / Full Width / Account surfaces pad with **Internal Tokens only**
- Cross-surface headers: set **padding** from the correct family — never reassign the other family's variables

